# Inputs written to cover cases the Kotlin tests don't.
# Format and updating: see tests/parse.rs.

=== if else chains by call joins
if (a) { b } else if (c) { d } else { e }
--- tree
(CallJoin
  (Curly (Paren if "(" a ")") { b })
  callJoin:
  (CallJoin
    (Curly (Paren [else if] "(" c ")") { d })
    callJoin:
    (Curly else { e })))

=== leading comma, which crashes Kotlin
, x
--- tree
(Comma , x)
